# Boost on 07's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# The gym's trainers and Cress (trdata #13: Lillipup 12, Panpour 14; scr 0014 @0x0982) wear the starter and the
# Dreamyard's Pansage down between heals: on White the leader whited both out (ended in the Striaton PC, zone 8).
# A carrier for when they faint (auto_battle sends the best of the party): Blitzle (522) at 20, Electric against
# Panpour, with Shock Wave (351), Flame Charge (488), Quick Attack (98) and Thunder Wave (86). It carries on to
# Route 3 (10), where the multi battle and the trainers leave no Pokemon Center between them.
party 522 20
party-move 2 0 351
party-move 2 1 488
party-move 2 2 98
party-move 2 3 86
